  "summary": {
    "zh": "AlexNet 以深度卷积网络、GPU 训练、ReLU、数据增强和 dropout 在 ImageNet 上取得突破性结果。",
    "en": "AlexNet achieved a breakthrough on ImageNet by combining deep convolutional networks, GPU training, ReLU, data augmentation, and dropout."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "2012 年，Alex Krizhevsky、Ilya Sutskever 和 Geoffrey Hinton 的 AlexNet 在 ImageNet 竞赛中显著降低图像分类错误率，使深度卷积神经网络成为现代计算机视觉的核心路线。",
    "en": "In 2012, Alex Krizhevsky, Ilya Sutskever, and Geoffrey Hinton introduced AlexNet, which substantially reduced ImageNet classification error and made deep convolutional networks central to modern computer vision."
  },
